    "created_at": "2016-06-16T06:35:48Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-06-16T06:35:48Z",
    "body": "I see, we can probably rename that. Having said that, I suspect that eventually we'll merge both call sites of that algorithm at which point we can just inline it and the name will be gone.\n\nHaving two different places to set up the global environment in the standard is clearly broken and has led to many subtle bugs.\n",
